:: OC Kade Park Cat Saving [nobr]

/* Intro */
You have been playing on the merry-go-round for a few minutes now, spinning at high speeds so much you collapse onto the grass, unable to even tell which way is up and feeling a little sick. <span style="Color: Yellow">You are lying there recovering when you see some movement nearby and glance up to see a bit of commotion nearby.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, Ms. Kitty, please come down!”</span> An old lady in dark clothes is wagging something up a tree, trying to get the attention of a bright brown cat that is lounging up on one of the high branches. You steady yourself and stand up to walk over, maybe to see the situation from up close or maybe to offer your help, <span style="Color: Yellow">but before you even are fully on your feet you see someone else already rushing over!</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "OC Kade",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>


<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Don’t worry, I got her.”</span> The boy is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span>, your nerdy and quiet classmate. You know that he does karate and even saw his muscles in the locker room but seeing him skillfully climb up the tree with little to no effort, as if he were a cat himself, is still surprising! <span style="Color: LightGreen">Both you and the old woman watch in awe as the boy scammers up, picks up the cat in one hand, who seems to be calmed by his presence and doesn’t even fight a little, before he pounces down, naturally landing perfectly.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Here you go, hope she wasn’t too scared.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, thank you, young man!”</span> The old woman takes the cat and gives <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> a big hug and a large kiss on the cheek, causing the boy to turn bright pink. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, you are such a kind and strong boy. Thank you! Thank you so much!”</span> She gives him a few more kisses on the cheek before letting <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> go. The boy wipes his damp cheek on his shirt with a chuckle until he sees you watching with an amused smirk. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Uhh…”</span> He gives you a nervous laugh and wave, <span style="Color: Pink">looking absolutely embarrassed as he quickly turns on his heels and rushes off!</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> really is such a kind and surprisingly agile boy.</span> <br>
<<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
<<needChange "Fun" 25>>
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
<<socialChange "Kade" 1 1>>
<br>
[[Continue|Park]] 